description:
Turn the Reposition 2 placeholders into live features as Papyrus delivers them:
- public, labelled AI drafts and the Proposals queue;
- voting on any subject, with downvotes;
- editor override and vote exclusion;
- AI trend stories, and promoting an insight to a concept;
- the Graph and River views from weekly history;
- AI-drafted sections of The Weekly;
- a scheduled knowledge run.

Every reader write also depends on the Google OAuth fix (ship-63b07d).
